3139
02:08:16.778 --> 02:08:18.649
Not in this vein.

3140
02:08:18.649 --> 02:08:21.168
A lot of people are doing that currently.

3141
02:08:21.168 --> 02:08:22.001
Currently.

3142
02:08:22.001 --> 02:08:22.920
Across the spectrum.

3143
02:08:22.920 --> 02:08:25.339
On a lot of channels.

3144
02:08:25.339 --> 02:08:27.710
