3256
02:13:33.048 --> 02:13:36.620
without having to be stressed out about

3257
02:13:36.620 --> 02:13:39.453
any sort of overlord or, you know-

3258
02:13:41.379 --> 02:13:43.343
Yeah, (indistinct) a mind reader.

3259
02:13:43.343 --> 02:13:44.885
I mean, pursuit of happiness in the context

3260
02:13:44.885 --> 02:13:48.664
