3261
02:13:48.664 --> 02:13:52.101
I think meant or means like the freedom

3262
02:13:52.101 --> 02:13:54.515
to go do whatever the fuck you wanna do.

3263
02:13:54.515 --> 02:13:56.465
Basically without the crown getting involved.

3264
