3281
02:14:31.204 --> 02:14:33.405
It's not a fasted state.

3282
02:14:33.405 --> 02:14:34.621
That happiness is it?

3283
02:14:34.621 --> 02:14:36.792
No, that's why I moved on to the avocado toast.

3284
02:14:36.792 --> 02:14:39.062
