The first of these ideas is the need to be a people pleaser.

3299
02:15:01.551 --> 02:15:03.972
And the second is maintaining a service mindset.

3300
02:15:03.972 --> 02:15:06.790
No matter what obstacles in life someone is facing,

3301
02:15:06.790 --> 02:15:09.590
helping others is one thing that will always bring more joy

3302
02:15:09.590 --> 02:15:11.060
