3305
02:15:14.491 --> 02:15:15.891
However, I'm also trying to become

3306
02:15:15.891 --> 02:15:18.771
less of a people pleaser by staying true to my values

3307
02:15:18.771 --> 02:15:21.111
and opinions and not bending them to fit the idea

3308
02:15:21.111 --> 02:15:22.629
