3309
02:15:22.629 --> 02:15:25.668
As an anagram type nine, which is the peacekeeper.

3310
02:15:25.668 --> 02:15:27.520
My natural tendency is to avoid conflict

3311
02:15:27.520 --> 02:15:28.611
and be liked by others.

3312
02:15:28.611 --> 02:15:31.110
Reinforcing my need to please people.

3313
02:15:31.110 --> 02:15:33.133
I pair that with the mission of serving others

3314
02:15:33.133 --> 02:15:35.267
through kindness and warmth, and I find it really hard

3315
02:15:35.267 --> 02:15:38.860
to be authentically myself while navigating day to day life.

3316
02:15:38.860 --> 02:15:40.683
So this is one long way of asking,

3317
02:15:40.683 --> 02:15:42.999
where do you draw the line between people pleasing

3318
02:15:42.999 --> 02:15:44.582
