3323
02:15:55.172 --> 02:15:57.921
Yes, I thought it was a phenomenal question.

3324
02:15:57.921 --> 02:15:59.099
It's unbelievable.

3325
02:15:59.099 --> 02:16:00.620
I wish I don't know how old Abby is,

3326
02:16:00.620 --> 02:16:05.399
but that level of self-understanding I think is huge.

3327
02:16:05.399 --> 02:16:06.232
I agree.

3328
02:16:06.232 --> 02:16:07.461
And I love this anagram type nine.

3329
02:16:07.461 --> 02:16:08.619
I don't even know what that is,

