Okay.

3337
02:16:22.626 --> 02:16:23.626
All right.

3338
02:16:24.610 --> 02:16:26.985
I'll refresh mine, and see where I'm at.

3339
02:16:26.985 --> 02:16:28.314
We can hash it out.

3340
02:16:28.314 --> 02:16:29.304
All right, let's do it.

3341
02:16:29.304 --> 02:16:30.724
I think it's a really interesting question.

3342
02:16:30.724 --> 02:16:32.543
I relate to it a lot.

3343
02:16:32.543 --> 02:16:36.710
I understand that tension between people pleasing,

3344
02:16:38.096 --> 02:16:40.554
serving others and trying to establish

3345
02:16:40.554 --> 02:16:43.062
some kind of healthy boundary.

3346
02:16:43.062 --> 02:16:47.395
And I think unpacking that begins with first of all,

3347
02:16:50.577 --> 02:16:53.375
kind of a peek into your motivations.

3348
02:16:53.375 --> 02:16:56.585
Is your service this kindness or these other things

3349
02:16:56.585 --> 02:16:58.660
that you're doing on behalf of others?

3350
02:16:58.660 --> 02:17:02.044
Is it motivated by a desire to be liked

3351
02:17:02.044 --> 02:17:06.627
or is it motivated by the impact that it has on others?

3352
02:17:07.814 --> 02:17:10.823
And I guess then in turn your own sense of self.

3353
02:17:10.823 --> 02:17:12.914
Sort of getting clear on what your motivations are.

3354
02:17:12.914 --> 02:17:15.344
I think is important.

3355
02:17:15.344 --> 02:17:18.094
And perhaps even more elementary,

3356
02:17:18.975 --> 02:17:21.791
getting clear about your values.

3357
02:17:21.791 --> 02:17:22.993
What are your values?

3358
02:17:22.993 --> 02:17:25.795
So when you're acting in a way that feels like

3359
02:17:25.795 --> 02:17:27.543
it's not authentically you,

3360
02:17:27.543 --> 02:17:29.540
that's an indication that your behavior

3361
02:17:29.540 --> 02:17:32.997
is not aligned with your core values on some level.

3362
02:17:32.997 --> 02:17:37.247
So developing a practice of checking your decisions

3363
02:17:38.607 --> 02:17:40.668
against that value set

3364
02:17:40.668 --> 02:17:44.578
will help you calibrate your behavior

3365
02:17:44.578 --> 02:17:46.586
and your level of alignment.

3366
02:17:46.586 --> 02:17:48.987
So again, clarity about those values

3367
02:17:48.987 --> 02:17:50.015
if you have to write them out.

3368
02:17:50.015 --> 02:17:52.855
What are those core sets of values?

3369
02:17:52.855 --> 02:17:55.744
And when throughout the course of your day,

3370
02:17:55.744 --> 02:17:56.968
when you're people pleasing

3371
02:17:56.968 --> 02:17:59.507
and trying to be kind to people or whatever.

3372
02:17:59.507 --> 02:18:01.369
Where do you feel like those behaviors

3373
02:18:01.369 --> 02:18:03.840
come into conflict with your values.

3374
02:18:03.840 --> 02:18:07.025
I think is a good place or a good lens

3375
02:18:07.025 --> 02:18:11.108
through which to kind of deconstruct all of this.

3376
02:18:12.440 --> 02:18:15.690
If you're people pleasing out of a need

3377
02:18:16.800 --> 02:18:18.633
to maintain the peace,

3378
02:18:19.610 --> 02:18:22.219
but that ends up being contrary to your values

3379
02:18:22.219 --> 02:18:25.449
or violate some kind of personal boundary.

3380
02:18:25.449 --> 02:18:28.419
Then that's good information that you need

3381
02:18:28.419 --> 02:18:32.462
to realign your behavior to get it more consistent

3382
02:18:32.462 --> 02:18:34.139
with your value system.

3383
02:18:34.139 --> 02:18:36.752
So your value system value set,

3384
02:18:36.752 --> 02:18:39.759
dictates the boundary and protecting that boundary

3385
02:18:39.759 --> 02:18:43.651
at times, demands that you potentially place yourself

3386
02:18:43.651 --> 02:18:45.591
in conflict with others,

3387
02:18:45.591 --> 02:18:48.672
which then violates your peacekeeping disposition.

3388
02:18:48.672 --> 02:18:51.273
And that's where the discomfort comes in.

3389
02:18:51.273 --> 02:18:54.208
You don't wanna bum anyone out,

3390
02:18:54.208 --> 02:18:56.291
but you also wanna be true to yourself.

3391
02:18:56.291 --> 02:19:00.462
And I suspect that you're somebody who would rather

3392
02:19:00.462 --> 02:19:03.388
say the thing that makes people feel comfortable

3393
02:19:03.388 --> 02:19:05.727
rather than adhering to a boundary

3394
02:19:05.727 --> 02:19:09.105
or making sure that you're being true to your self.

3395
02:19:09.105 --> 02:19:11.169
And I think that's the growth opportunity,

3396
02:19:11.169 --> 02:19:12.836
like recognizing that.

3397
02:19:12.836 --> 02:19:15.387
And when those moments arise,

3398
02:19:15.387 --> 02:19:17.015
can you set a healthy boundary.

3399
02:19:17.015 --> 02:19:20.248
Do it graciously, so you're not upending

3400
02:19:20.248 --> 02:19:22.196
the piece unnecessarily,

3401
02:19:22.196 --> 02:19:24.329
but also respecting yourself.

3402
02:19:24.329 --> 02:19:27.127
And I think when you do that, as uncomfortable as it is,

3403
02:19:27.127 --> 02:19:29.495
there's a little kind of dollop of self-esteem.

3404
02:19:29.495 --> 02:19:32.303
A little kernel of self-esteem that you're planting

3405
02:19:32.303 --> 02:19:34.958
that allows you to start to get more comfortable

3406
02:19:34.958 --> 02:19:35.968
with who you are.

3407
02:19:35.968 --> 02:19:37.754
And I think you'll also find that,

3408
02:19:37.754 --> 02:19:39.614
look the peacekeeping thing,

3409
02:19:39.614 --> 02:19:43.117
the people pleasing thing that comes out of

3410
02:19:43.117 --> 02:19:44.316
a lack of self-esteem.

3411
02:19:44.316 --> 02:19:46.507
Oh if I don't tell them what they wanna hear,

3412
02:19:46.507 --> 02:19:47.854
then they're not gonna like me

3413
02:19:47.854 --> 02:19:51.185
and my opinion isn't valued or whatever.

3414
02:19:51.185 --> 02:19:53.465
But in truth, people respect you

3415
02:19:53.465 --> 02:19:55.467
when you demonstrate self-respect.

3416
02:19:55.467 --> 02:19:57.316
So by setting a healthy boundary and saying,

3417
02:19:57.316 --> 02:19:59.206
"I'm sorry, I know you want me to do that,

3418
02:19:59.206 --> 02:20:00.187
but I can't do that."

3419
02:20:00.187 --> 02:20:03.316
Or whatever the case may be, maybe uncomfortable.

3420
02:20:03.316 --> 02:20:04.149
And you're...

3421
02:20:04.149 --> 02:20:06.375
And every instinct inside your people pleasing body

3422
02:20:06.375 --> 02:20:08.526
will be saying, "Oh my God, they're gonna hate me now."

3423
02:20:08.526 --> 02:20:11.315
But ultimately they end up respecting you more.

3424
02:20:11.315 --> 02:20:14.426
And then you end up feeling better about who you are.

3425
02:20:14.426 --> 02:20:17.445
And then that muscle once flexed becomes easier to flex

3426
02:20:17.445 --> 02:20:19.433
the next time.

3427
02:20:19.433 --> 02:20:20.433
I love it.

3428
02:20:21.312 --> 02:20:23.701
Yeah, I mean, I'm a natural people pleaser

3429
