I mean, I don't think there's any disagreement around that.

3440
02:20:56.506 --> 02:21:01.506
I think it's when that urge or disposition to people please.

3441
02:21:01.842 --> 02:21:04.394
Let's say you're around a bunch of people

3442
02:21:04.394 --> 02:21:08.444
